                <p class="text-[1rem] font-inter text-gray-400 font-medium mt-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300" style="max-height: 0;">
                <span class="block">There is currently no official API for Midjourney. However, we at Apiframe offer a powerful and rich-featured API to automate Midjourney AI image creation. </span>

                <span class="block my-2">This allows developers, product owners, etc. to fully leverage Midjourney AI's image generation capabilities through a stable and scalable API.</span>

