                    </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[1rem] font-inter text-gray-400 font-medium mt-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300" style="max-height: 0;">
                <span class="block">We offer APIs for <a href="/ai-image-generation" class="text-[#e8861b]">ai image generation</a>, <a href="/ai-photos-generation" class="text-[#e8861b]">ai photos</a>, <a href="/ai-video-generation" class="text-[#e8861b]">ai video generation</a>, <a href="/ai-music-generation" class="text-[#e8861b]">ai music generation</a>, and <a href="/ai-faceswap" class="text-[#e8861b]">face swapping</a>, with more being added regularly.</span>

                    <span class="block mt-4">- For AI image generation, we offer: the Midjourney API, Ideogram API, Flux API, and more.</span>
                    <span class="block mt-3">- For AI video generation, we offer: the Runway API, Luma API, Kling API, and more.</span>
                    <span class="block mt-3">- For AI music generation, we offer: the Suno API, the Udio API, and more.</span>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#2B2E3D] bg-opacity-40 rounded-xl p-5">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <h3 class="text-[1rem] font-inter font-medium text-[#fff]">
                        Do I need coding experience?
                    </h3>
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white transition-transform duration-300">
                        add
                    </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[1rem] font-inter text-gray-400 font-medium mt-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300" style="max-height: 0;">
                    No! Apiframe can be used with or without code through our no-code integrations with popular platforms.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#2B2E3D] bg-opacity-40 rounded-xl p-5">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <h3 class="text-[1rem] font-inter font-medium text-[#fff]">
                        Is there a free trial?
                    </h3>
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white transition-transform duration-300">
                        add
                    </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[1rem] font-inter text-gray-400 font-medium mt-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300" style="max-height: 0;">
                No, we don't offer a free trial but a paid trial for $10. <a href="https://app.apiframe.ai/signup" class="text-[#e8861b]">Get Access here</a>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#2B2E3D] bg-opacity-40 rounded-xl p-5">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <h3 class="text-[1rem] font-inter font-medium text-[#fff]">
                    Do generated images expire?
                    </h3>
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white transition-transform duration-300">
                        add
                    </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[1rem] font-inter text-gray-400 font-medium mt-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300" style="max-height: 0;">
                <span class="block">Generated images don't ever expire. We host generated images on our private CDN, and they will stay available forever in opposite to other Midjourney API providers.</span>

                <span class="block my-2">Our CDN with powerful caching features allows you to load even large images fast.</span>
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <script>
            function toggleFaq(element) {
                const answer = element.nextElementSibling;
                const icon = element.querySelector('.material-symbols-outlined');
                
                // Toggle icon rotation
                icon.style.transform = icon.style.transform === 'rotate(45deg)' ? 'rotate(0deg)' : 'rotate(45deg)';
                
                // Toggle content height
                if (answer.style.maxHeight === '0px' || !answer.style.maxHeight) {
                    answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + 'px';
                    answer.style.marginTop = '0.5rem';
                } else {
                    answer.style.maxHeight = '0px';
                    answer.style.marginTop = '0';
                }
            }
        </script>
    </div>
